# Size in bytes of the netstandard2.0 Release MoonSharp.Interpreter.dll as tools/size/size.sh
# builds it. CI (the size job in .github/workflows/ci.yml) fails when the DLL is more than
# 512 bytes larger or smaller than this number.
#
# A change that grows the DLL on purpose puts the new size, as size.sh prints it, here in the
# same commit and says why in the commit body. A change that shrinks it lowers the number, so
# later growth is measured from there.
434688
